From cc6ce56e1e73d006d12c283df20b76b6a5a88821 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "qwen.ai[bot]" <qwenlm-intl@service.alibaba.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:20:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Fix OHLCV_CHUNK_PAUSE NameError and add focus-universe
 safety guard

- app/collector.py: Define missing OHLCV_CHUNK_PAUSE constant (1.5s) to prevent _ohlcv_loop crash; implement chunked OHLCV fetching with semaphore throttling (_sem_rest) to avoid blocking interactive candle requests
- app/api.py: Add _restrict_universe helper to validate exchange alignment before applying focus key_set in select(); prevent data loss when REST queries target exchanges outside the current focus scope
- Overall stability improved by resolving critical startup errors and ensuring full market visibility for non-focused API endpoints
---
 crypto-screener/app/api.py       | 29 ++++++++++-
 crypto-screener/app/collector.py | 82 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 102 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crypto-screener/app/api.py b/crypto-screener/app/api.py
